notes.notes:
1. Reduced pirate locations with ships;

2. Fixed bug with throwing weapons;

3. Changed the name “Queenie” to “Nina”;

4. UI when we want to exit the game when pressing ESC during the game;

5. Localization of the main items in the menu;

6. Daily task icons on the tiles;

7. New professional voice acting of a “dwarf-pirate” seller at a location with ships;

9. New professional voice acting for a physician at a location with ships;

10. A lighthouse for entourage in a location with ships;

11. Localization in Russian and English in daily tasks;

12. The statuses of daily tasks are now displayed as unfulfilled, completed, which will allow you to pick up a reward, and are blocked until the next daily reset, resetting daily tasks will take place at 23.59: 59;

13. Available quest and charging coins for daily entry into the game;

14. Improvements on the server side in terms of optimization and logs;

15. The quest "Conqueror" is available to break 30 blocks;

16. Available quest “Slaughter” to play 10 games;

17. Available quest “Came, saw, won” - win one game;

18. The quest “Victory Series” is available - win 3 games during the day;

20. The quest “Art of battle" is available - to kill 25 players;

21. The main screen now displays the number of tasks the completed counter and the total;

22. Fixed a bug when the menu does not show who is waiting for the game on the list;

23. Statistics are now available to all users, but have been reset;

24. At the location with the ships, a bug with respawn of chests at the base was fixed;

25. At a location with trains, fixed a bug with respawn of chests at the base;

26. Chests on the game platform are now cut within the platform - train location;

27. Fixed bug with “respawn” of chests on ships;

28. Fixed bug with “respawn” of chests on airships;

29. Added “experimental” shooting mode;

[olist]
 Added new voice acting for characters at the level with airships;
 New “custom” characters at the level of airships;
 Reworked shooting;
 All locations now have illuminated signs indicating where the store or doctor is for better orientation on the platforms;
 Partial localization of the main menu;
 New seller-level model with ships;
 The settings now save the settings for sounds and music;
 In the menu, a boot screen that expects to connect to the server and blocks the player’s actions
 The button to exit the game when pressing ESC during the game, which confused the players;
 Improved shooting for the test;
 Localization of the menu;
 Ability to throw weapons or blocks for other players;
 A bug with the purchase of excess cartridge in the store;
 Now when the weapon is completely shot it disappears from inventory;
